    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fairy Tale Exploration Journey</strong><br>Each level is a whimsical adventure through fantastical storybook worlds. Our signature thick-painted hand-drawn art style makes every frame wallpaper-worthy - the game's true visual hallmark. Complemented by custom-crafted background music for each environment, this creates an immersive atmosphere that fully draws you into the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.poster.avif?t=1754898727\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.webm?t=1754898727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.mp4?t=1754898727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique storybook worlds + 1 secret chapter\u300130+ interactive NPC characters\u30011,200 collectible items to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Gameplay Features \u2726</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Main Quest</strong><br>Progress through the narrative by collecting yarn balls hidden across environments to unlock the game's true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Side Quests</strong><br>Help vibrant NPC characters by completing their item collection requests in different scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Secret Chapter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Postcard Mode by collecting canned food during main story progression, then gather Cat Collars from treasure chests in this mode to access bonus challenges and uncover hidden storylines! <i>(Psst... exclusive secret narrative included!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Artistic Discovery</strong><br>Explore richly textured painterly landscapes filled with classic IP-inspired Easter eggs and visual surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports the following languages: <br>Simplified Chinese,Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese - Brazil, and German.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fairy Tale Exploration Journey</strong><br>Each level is a whimsical adventure through fantastical storybook worlds. Our signature thick-painted hand-drawn art style makes every frame wallpaper-worthy - the game's true visual hallmark. Complemented by custom-crafted background music for each environment, this creates an immersive atmosphere that fully draws you into the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.poster.avif?t=1754898727\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.webm?t=1754898727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603580/extras/a2b1ca2dddddad1c5b85c2f81f65101a.mp4?t=1754898727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique storybook worlds + 1 secret chapter\u300130+ interactive NPC characters\u30011,200 collectible items to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2726 Gameplay Features \u2726</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Main Quest</strong><br>Progress through the narrative by collecting yarn balls hidden across environments to unlock the game's true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Side Quests</strong><br>Help vibrant NPC characters by completing their item collection requests in different scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Secret Chapter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Postcard Mode by collecting canned food during main story progression, then gather Cat Collars from treasure chests in this mode to access bonus challenges and uncover hidden storylines! <i>(Psst... exclusive secret narrative included!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Artistic Discovery</strong><br>Explore richly textured painterly landscapes filled with classic IP-inspired Easter eggs and visual surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports the following languages: <br>Simplified Chinese,Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese - Brazil, and German.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a leisurely journey through a kitten's eyes, where the world blossoms into a realm of magical whimsy. Whisker Wanderlust is here! Help the mischievous kitten (who just shredded their human's 376th yarn ball) collect treasures from distant lands\u2665",
